From: Alessio Dondoni <alessio.dondoni08@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:44:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] sweet: HarmonyOS (OpenHarmony 5.0.5) userspace bring-up

- accesstokenid driver and task_struct token/ftoken (from OpenHarmony kernel_linux_5.10)
- binder: BINDER_FEATURE_SET, BINDER_GET_ACCESS_TOKEN, BINDER_GET_SENDER_INFO
- optional PARTNAME uevent for dm devices (OHOS_DM_PARTNAME, off)
- bring-up switches: hmos.noreboot=1 (reboot/sysrq panic), hmos.permissive=1
- vendor/ohos.config: EROFS on, binderfs off so /dev/binder exists

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013BnD2kisuqqyfphx6EWB2p
